# Toolshop QA Assessment Rules

- SUT UI: https://practicesoftwaretesting.com/
- SUT API: https://api.practicesoftwaretesting.com
- Stack: Playwright with Prism-style structure (UI + API)
- Cap: 5–8 test cases per type (manual, UI, API); tag @Smoke and @Regression
- UI invoice: press Confirm **twice**
- Core payment: cash-on-delivery
- Never invent API endpoints or selectors — verify against live SUT / OpenAPI
- One task per chat; summarize into ai-prompts/*.md after each phase
- Do not commit secrets, real PII, or raw bearer tokens
- Prefer Auto/Composer for docs; coding model only for automation and hard debugging
